 \\\\  & =-\\frac{{u}^{3}}{3}{|}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =[-\\frac{(1)^{3}}{3}]-[-\\frac{(0)^{3}}{3}] \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{3}+0 \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186428586 #edb/ref 1030 1.0 #edb/ref 17592186045436] [17592186428586 #edb/ref 1032 "Initial Codex estimate from captured target-band crossing frequency. Selected account linear: 1 rises / 1 eligible passed source activities = 1.000000; nearest selected fraction = 1. Crossing activity numbers [1]; waits [1]. Separate account estimates: linear=1 (1/1). Selection: most observations, then lower weight, then account name; no averaging. Single-activity estimates included. Intervening target updates: False. Crossing frequency is the chosen practical estimate of encompassing coverage; a multi-band rise counts once. This does not interpret color steps as physical repetition units. Method: encompassing-report.md. Evidence: reference/mathacademy/encompassing-analysis-2026-10-11/frequency-fractions/linear-frequency-estimates.json, pair 2096->1849. All account evidence retained in the prepared import's selected-relationships.json." #edb/ref 17592186045436] [17592186428586 #edb/ref 1036 #edb/ref 17592186049814 #edb/ref 17592186045436] [17592186512093 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186512979 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186512093 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186512984 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186512093 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186512993 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186512093 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186512996 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186512093 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186513004 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186512093 #edb/ref 1044 #edb/ref 17592186045464 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186512093 #edb/ref 1045 "Inner Product Spaces" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186512093 #edb/ref 1046 #edb/ref 17592186512996 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186512093 #edb/ref 1048 #edb/ref 17592186046658 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186512093 #edb/ref 1049 #edb/ref 17592186048169 #edb/re